{
  "date": "2026-11-18",
  "category": "fintech",
  "title_zh": "交行在深圳推出三款数字人民币产品，方便外国人付款",
  "title_en": "Bank of Communications launches three digital yuan products in Shenzhen to make paying easier for foreigners",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "11月17日，交通银行深圳分行在深圳开了一场发布会，推出了三款和数字人民币有关的新产品，主要给来中国的外国人使用。数字人民币是中国人民银行发行的数字形式的人民币。中国移动下面的金融科技公司中移金科，还有银联国际和中国银联深圳分公司，也参加了这次活动。",
      "en": "On November 17, the Shenzhen branch of Bank of Communications held a launch event in Shenzhen and introduced three new products related to the digital yuan, mainly for foreigners who come to China. The digital yuan is a digital form of the renminbi issued by the People's Bank of China. China Mobile's fintech company CMFT (China Mobile Fintech), together with UnionPay International and China UnionPay's Shenzhen branch, also took part in the event."
    },
    {
      "zh": "第一款产品是一种SIM卡“硬钱包”，是中移金科和交通银行一起开发的。外国人拿着护照，就能在指定的中国移动营业厅开通、充值和退款。有了这张手机卡，可以直接刷手机坐地铁和公交；就算手机没电、没有网络，碰一下也能付款。",
      "en": "The first product is a SIM-card \"hard wallet\", developed jointly by CMFT and Bank of Communications. With their passport, foreigners can activate it, top it up and get refunds at designated China Mobile service halls. With this SIM card, they can tap their phone to take the metro and buses directly; even if the phone has no battery or no network, they can still pay with a tap."
    },
    {
      "zh": "第二款产品让外国人可以用境外发行的银联国际卡，在网上给数字人民币钱包充值。他们不用换中国的手机号，也不用去银行网点。这项服务很快就会正式上线。在发布会上，交行深圳分行还和银联国际签了合作协议。",
      "en": "The second product lets foreigners use UnionPay International cards issued outside China to top up their digital yuan wallets online. They don't need to switch to a Chinese phone number or go to a bank branch. This service will officially go live soon. At the launch event, the Bank of Communications Shenzhen branch also signed a cooperation agreement with UnionPay International."
    },
    {
      "zh": "第三款产品是一种十二星座主题的硬钱包，看起来像一个小饰品。用户不用打开手机，碰一下就能付钱。",
      "en": "The third product is a hard wallet with a twelve-zodiac-signs theme that looks like a small accessory. Users don't need to open their phone — they can pay with just a tap."
    }
  ],
